      players: 'Two players represent bowler and batsman, or four players can play team versions.',
      deck: 'Use two identical 55-card decks with five cricket-equipment suits numbered 1 to 11.',
      equipment: 'Dedicated 110-card cricket deck with five suits numbered 1 to 11, score area, and enough table space for play.',
      dealing: 'Deal hidden hands to the batting and bowling sides according to the selected cricket format.',
    },
    turnFlow: 'The bowler plays a delivery card and the batsman responds with a shot card. Same-suit higher cards score runs by the difference; lower off-suit cards can produce wickets. Optional no-ball, extras, lower-order, and two-card-shot rules add cricket detail.',
